This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It is a MUTATION BATTERY behind core/scripts/derive-fixture-readsets.sh: every arm renders a sandbox
profile from the deriver's own emitter text, and four of its renderings come from edited copies of
that core source. It also needs `log stream` outside any sandbox, which no traced run and no consumer
gate guarantees, so on a consumer it could only report SKIP. It was split out of
readset-stage1-verdict (itself dist-only) so that fixture stays traceable.
